        "id": "enhance_arrow_1",
        "name": "Enhance Arrow +1",
        "category": "su",
        "description": "Every nonmagical arrow nocked gains a +1 enhancement bonus (+2 at 3rd, +3 at 5th, +4 at 7th, +5 at 9th).",
